# CVE-2026-27904 - glob: ReDoS via backtracking in glob expressions
# Reason: The `glob` package is a transitive dependency of jest/test-exclude (devDependency).
# It is NOT used at runtime in the Docker image. Fixing it would require glob v11
# which breaks the jest test-exclude package. Risk is accepted for dev tooling only.
# Review: Upgrade test-exclude when it officially supports glob v11.
CVE-2026-27904
